# ws159-p003: the test touch pad of /dev/input-inject (touchinject's pad).
# One finger down and moving, a second finger, the pad pressed and released
# with both on it, then both lifted.  The size is the Latitude 5330's pad.
pad 1336 760 5 scan
wait 300
down 0 600 300
wait 20
move 0 620 300
wait 20
down 1 800 320
wait 20
press
wait 20
release
wait 20
up 0; up 1
hold 300
